The architecture leverages Resilience4j to wrap all external calls (Kafka, gRPC). Circuit breakers prevent cascading failures, retries provide transient fault tolerance, and bulkheads protect against resource exhaustion. Metrics (latency, error rates) are exposed via Micrometer and visualized in Grafana, allowing operators to detect bottlenecks before they affect end users.

